"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/e13dea0d-ede7-436a-a2bb-1a996ca824e2.webp"},"provider":"streamingunity"}],"episodeMappingUncertain":false,"seasons":[],"provenance":{},"warnings":[],"externalIdsEvidence":{"wikidata":{"source":"wikidata","sourceUrl":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1777589","wikidataId":"Q1777589","tmdbId":187504,"type":"movie","imdbId":"tt2223388","tvdbId":72358}},"externalMedia":{"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":187504,"type":"movie","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/187504","fetchedAt":"2026-11-08T04:35:44.716Z","originalLanguage":"de-DE","title":{"value":"Messner","language":"en-US"},"originalTitle":"Messner","overview":{"value":"Reinhold Messner è uno degli alpinisti più famosi della storia. L'ambizione e il desiderio di superare i limiti del possibile e il continuo miglioramento della resistenza umana sono i suoi tratti distintivi. Il film racconta la sua straordinaria vita attraverso interviste con Messner stesso e con coloro che hanno incrociato la sua strada: dalla volontà di lasciare quella casa che già dall'infanzia gli andava stretta, fino ai successi e gli insuccessi delle sue più pericolose spedizioni.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Wer ist dieser Mann? Wo kommt er her? Was treibt ihn an?","language":"de-DE"},"releaseDate":"2012-09-26","status":"Released","rating":6.4,"ratingCount":17,"genres":["Avventura","Documentario"],"countries":["Germany"],"facts":{"Runtime":"108m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":1081317,"name":"Reinhold Messner","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vX0iOTrdmUnnOeXOYXpEcWu2f46.jpg"},{"id":1287622,"name":"Peter Habeler","role":"Self","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eDhXYC8rFVzAljedfge3vvlxvS0.jpg"},{"id":1169099,"name":"Hans Kammerlander","role":"Self"},{"id":5024932,"name":"Maurice Cretton","role":"Self"},{"id":5024934,"name":"Maxime Belleville","role":"Self"},{"id":5024936,"name":"Horst Frankhauser","role":"Self"},{"id":5024937,"name":"Ursula Grether-Endres","role":"Self"},{"id":5024938,"name":"Helmut Messner","role":"Self"},{"id":3398625,"name":"Hubert Messner","role":"Self"},{"id":3410618,"name":"Florian Riegler","role":"Reinhold Messner (adult)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Reinhold Messner è uno degli alpinisti più famosi della storia. L'ambizione e il desiderio di superare i limiti del possibile e il continuo miglioramento della resistenza umana sono i suoi tratti distintivi. Il film racconta la sua straordinaria vita attraverso interviste con Messner stesso e con coloro che hanno incrociato la sua strada: dalla volontà di lasciare quella casa che già dall'infanzia gli andava stretta, fino ai successi e gli insuccessi delle sue più pericolose spedizioni."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Messner","overview":"Born in 1944 in South Tyrol, Reinhold Messner was introduced to climbing peaks by his father as a child. He has since climbed the fourteen mountains of the world culminating at more than 8,000 meters, and notably has to his credit the first ascent of Everest alone and without oxygen in 1980. This portrait is made up of the story given by mountaineer of his journey as well as testimonies from his loved ones and traveling companions. The interviews are interspersed with reconstructed scenes and extracts from archive films recounting his exploits. But there is no question here of becoming hagiographic, because Messner also draws his strength from his failures. When he's not climbing or roaming the desert, this troublemaker devotes his energy to various causes. In his Juval castle, located in his native South Tyrol, he exhibits the equipment of his expeditions as well as various objects, notably Tibetan. He has also written around fifty works to date."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Der 1944 in Südtirol geborene Reinhold Messner seitdem hat er die vierzehn Berge der Welt bestiegen, deren Höhepunkt mehr als 8.000 Meter beträgt, und kann sich insbesondere die Erstbesteigung des Everest allein und ohne Sauerstoff im Jahr 1980 zu eigen machen. Dieses Porträt besteht aus der Geschichte, die der Bergsteiger von seiner Reise erzählt hat sowie Zeugnisse seiner Lieben und Reisegefährten. Die Interviews sind durchsetzt mit rekonstruierten Szenen und Auszügen aus Archivfilmen, die von seinen Heldentaten erzählen. Doch von Hagiographie kann hier keine Rede sein, denn Messner schöpft seine Kraft auch aus seinen Misserfolgen. Wenn er nicht gerade klettert oder durch die Wüste streift, widmet dieser Unruhestifter seine Energie verschiedenen Zwecken. In seinem Schloss Juval in seiner Heimat Südtirol stellt er die Ausrüstung seiner Expeditionen sowie verschiedene Gegenstände, insbesondere tibetische, aus.","tagline":"Wer ist dieser Mann? Wo kommt er her? Was treibt ihn an?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qt4JivnKSeK6THjKf2hKWvknUk4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32jDFqk1irCEZQKwgB6lu1iLIUD.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":187504,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6RMDsIgLJ2CqAbQO1b2hmEBwwyE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6RMDsIgLJ2CqAbQO1b2hmEBwwyE.jpg","language":"en","width":750,"height":1125},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6RMDsIgLJ2CqAbQO1b2hmEBwwyE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6RMDsIgLJ2CqAbQO1b2hmEBwwyE.jpg","language":"en","width":750,"height":1125}]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qt4JivnKSeK6THjKf2hKWvknUk4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qt4JivnKSeK6THjKf2hKWvknUk4.jpg","la